{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Sanctuary is a side-scrolling hardcore game focused on parrying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can control a knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight came to the sanctuary of the sword connected to the world of characters with various weapons and skills to become a Swordmaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them all to earn the right to challenge the Sword Saint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome every opponent and claim the title of Swordmaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can move, evade, defend, attack, and counter slash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defend at the exact moment the enemy's attack lands, it triggers a parry, which damages the enemy and partially recovers your own health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks deal less damage than parrying but can provoke enemy defenses and restrict their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move - A, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge - Shift while moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack - Left Mouse Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense - Right Mouse Click</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344250?t=1770031240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344250?t=1770031240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344250/d89b77540f54cbb5a6c38e21d6beb49a2387473f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770031240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344250/d89b77540f54cbb5a6c38e21d6beb49a2387473f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770031240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3409020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Sanctuary is a side-scrolling hardcore game focused on parrying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can control a knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight came to the sanctuary of the sword connected to the world of characters with various weapons and skills to become a Swordmaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them all to earn the right to challenge the Sword Saint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome every opponent and claim the title of Swordmaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can move, evade, defend, attack, and counter slash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defend at the exact moment the enemy's attack lands, it triggers a parry, which damages the enemy and partially recovers your own health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks deal less damage than parrying but can provoke enemy defenses and restrict their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move - A, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge - Shift while moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack - Left Mouse Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense - Right Mouse Click</p>","developers":["Voided"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344250/2d8da8f9e96e743e6f426cec24a04ded9825d3e9/header.jpg?t=1770031240","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3344250/1126076005/0c561dc011b62ee4fd5724218a6ca60bf18cd1ab/1768562886/dash_av1.mpd?t=176856330